cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "Design and validation of ADAR-recruiting RNAs for programmable RNA editing and exon skipping in mammalian cells using LEAPER"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-22"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RenJW418/rna-editing-pipeline"
url: "https://github.com/RenJW418/rna-editing-pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying the manuscript named in this record. The repository contains
  a Bash pipeline for paired-end NGS processing and target-site RNA editing
  analysis, and an R script for read-level dinucleotide counts at adjacent
  reference positions. The manuscript credits Jiwu Ren with implementation of
  the NGS analysis code. External analysis tools and sequencing data are not
  included in this source-code archive.
